flowchart LR
    System[System Admin]
    Support[Support Admin]
    Customer[Customer Admin]
    UI[Flat Admin Console UI]
    Control[Control Backend / Modules]
    Auth[Authorization]
    Tx[PostgreSQL Transaction]
    Resource[(Authoritative Resource State)]
    AuditDB[(Append-only Admin Audit Store)]
    Outbox[(Transactional Outbox)]
    SQS[(Amazon SQS)]
    Seg[SegLumberjack\nSanitized correlation only]
    Archive[(Immutable S3 Object-Lock Audit Checkpoints)]

    System --> UI
    Support --> UI
    Customer --> UI
    UI --> Control --> Auth

    Auth -->|authorized mutation| Tx
    Tx --> Resource
    Tx --> AuditDB
    Tx --> Outbox

    Outbox --> SQS
    Control -->|sanitized telemetry| Seg

    AuditDB -. signed/hash-chained checkpoints .-> Archive

    AuditDB -->|RBAC-scoped queries| Control
    Control -->|tables / filters / detail drawer| UI

    Note1[Support audit views never expose message body / raw MIME / attachment content]
    Note2[Impersonation preserves real actor + entered customer]
    Note3[Mutation + audit + outbox commit atomically where possible]
    Note4[Audit DB + immutable checkpoints are authoritative; SegLumberjack is diagnostic]

    AuditDB -.-> Note1
    Tx -.-> Note2
    Tx -.-> Note3
    Seg -.-> Note4
